                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear Colleague, I am writing to inform you about the recent hospitalisation of your 88-year-old female patient, admitted on 13/12/2019 due to an acute exacerbation of her known chronic obstructive pulmonary disease. On admission, she presented with increased dyspnoea, productive cough, and reduced oxygen saturation. Diagnostic workup included chest X-ray confirming hyperinflation without consolidation, arterial blood gas analysis revealing hypoxaemic respiratory failure, and blood tests showing mild inflammatory markers. Pulse oximetry was monitored continuously throughout her stay. She was treated with supplemental oxygen therapy, nebulised bronchodilators, systemic corticosteroids, and supportive intravenous fluids. The patient responded well to treatment with significant symptomatic improvement. She was discharged on 14/12/2019 in stable condition. Please continue her inhaled bronchodilator regimen and ensure close outpatient follow-up. Do not hesitate to contact me for further information.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
